# Jak 1: a scene of the underwater city (Lost Precursor City) or Rock Village's elevator down to it (LIST-0.1.1 item
# 43, a player: "got to under water city and a certain cutscene seemingly broke the game"). Run with
# JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=<continue point>, JAKVR_TEST_WARP=<the scene's trigger>, QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000 and
# JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1: a new game, the continue, then Jak put a metre over the trigger (frame 10000 is that moment);
# he lands on it (the buttons he rides) and dives onto it (a full jump, then X, Square in the air, twice near the top:
# the game takes the dive only once he rises slower than 6.5 m/s; the floor buttons are pressed by the dive).
# Pictures each second through the scene; then the left stick forward, to see him walk again and the view his.
